{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement. [[cite:obs-ad281c5d91cbd8c038f5c118aa74acf9302e6319 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n\nEach plot is 40 square metres. [[cite:obs-eb71350c6fa019f5a971b329d0c34c56d14a2976 \"40 square metres\"]]\n\nThe agreement does not otherwise state plot dimensions. [[cite:obs-ad281c5d91cbd8c038f5c118aa74acf9302e6319 \"# Garden agreement\n\n## Plots\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"4b309f1234b4c2e21712c51db966b5e3b545116071170e3bdf55f63f05e2ffaf","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"State the allocation rule with its direct quote and add the plot size claim (with source citation), plus a note that the agreement does not otherwise specify dimensions."}